# The site's preview build only (`npm run deploy:site-preview`, Vite's
# "preview" mode, which takes .env.production's addresses where this has
# none): the preview's own rooms Worker (rooms-worker/wrangler.preview.jsonc),
# which speaks this branch's room protocol while production's rooms speak
# the released one. The accounts Worker is production's, api.baheardle.com,
# its only address; it lets the preview's pages in. Not a secret.
VITE_ROOMS_URL=wss://ba-heardle-rooms-preview.shinrunner1st.workers.dev
